// THE READER'S FOLD IS DAEMON-HELD. A merge bubble never collapses on its own
// (owner ruling, 2026-10-08): not on a push, not on a return to the feed's
// tail, not on a page reload, not across a daemon restart. The webapp tells
// the daemon each fold the reader makes, the daemon records it on the bubble's
// durable head row (frontend.v1.FeedMergeHead.fold), and every later draw of
